					m_FriendlyName = "Monitor Observable"
					m_Description = "While active, manage child cursors based on the results of a boolean condition. When the observable result changes, the prior cursor will be canceled and the appropriate outflow will fire a new child cursor. Will monitor continuously until externally canceled."
